   "ruling": "Ruling: representation; project retained; model value dropped from the fixture. As the classm.ira.1 ruling on this line: the filer made no traditional IRA contributions for 2025 (line 11a $0.00, agreed), and the worksheet figures the deduction for such contributions (i1040gi p. 95, Line 20, \"If you made contributions to a traditional IRA for 2025, you may be able to take an IRA deduction\"); the project shows line 7a as $0.00 for a return without traditional contributions (ira.any_trad false) and the applicable amount otherwise. The model entered the applicable amount by the line 1 instruction (p. 97, \"$7,000 if under age 50 at the end of 2025\"). Line 12a, the smallest of lines 7a, 10 and 11a, is $0.00 either way (agreed); no printed amount changes. ira.line7a is not among the lines the gate-wave rewrite changed. [dropped]"
